      "writtenOn": "2019-12-13T19:59:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For cases that should be modules but are currently broken as modules, maybe Kconfig.gki is the place to enable them temporarily while we figure it out (and we should file a bug to track them). Better if we can make them modules.",
      "parentUuid": "097caecd_f049c793",
      "revId": "85d424fe79c2a69c895f46196873d4928873239c",
